WEBVTT

01:40.380 --> 01:41.260
Hey classmate,

01:42.080 --> 01:43.880
I forgot to top up my water card.

01:43.920 --> 01:45.380
Could I borrow yours?

01:47.420 --> 01:49.240
Do we know each other?

01:51.500 --> 01:53.120
I forgot to introduce myself

01:53.160 --> 01:54.300
during our English practice.

01:54.800 --> 01:57.220
I'm Jiang Qiaoxi.

01:57.760 --> 01:58.800
Pleasure to meet you.

02:01.120 --> 02:02.520
Not a pleasure for me.

02:03.580 --> 02:05.740
Also, I don't lend my water card
to just anyone.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.440
What's her deal with Jiang Qiaoxi?

02:08.479 --> 02:10.580
She seems kind of touchy.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.760
Jiang Qiaoxi, here. Use mine.

02:12.800 --> 02:14.160
Mine too if you want.

02:14.200 --> 02:15.640
It's alright. Thanks anyway.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.620
Our new classmate
is a bit slow to warm up.

02:30.660 --> 02:31.620
Let's all try to

02:31.660 --> 02:33.000
make her feel welcomed.

02:36.460 --> 02:37.460
That's the first time

02:37.500 --> 02:40.000
I've seen someone brush off
Jiang Qiaoxi like that.

02:40.040 --> 02:41.540
It was kind of crazy.

02:41.580 --> 02:44.380
Still, he handled it really politely.

02:44.420 --> 02:46.020
Didn't seem offended at all.

02:46.060 --> 02:48.140
That's just how he is. Always respectful.

02:49.540 --> 02:50.460
Yeah, true.

02:50.960 --> 02:51.920
But

02:51.960 --> 02:53.920
why'd she act like that with him?

02:53.960 --> 02:55.500
It's just a water card.

02:55.540 --> 02:58.320
She acted like Jiang Qiaoxi
had done something terrible to her.

02:59.420 --> 03:00.640
Do you think

03:00.680 --> 03:02.620
it had to do with English class earlier?

03:03.380 --> 03:04.520
She didn't get what he said

03:04.560 --> 03:05.460
and felt embarrassed?

03:05.960 --> 03:07.500
She just transferred into our class

03:07.540 --> 03:08.660
and already lost face?

03:09.160 --> 03:10.080
Makes sense.

03:10.120 --> 03:10.960
Think about it.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.500
If she got into Jialin Experimental
from Qunshan,

03:13.540 --> 03:14.640
she had to be top

03:14.680 --> 03:16.120
of her old class.

03:16.160 --> 03:18.120
Then she just got here
and run into Jiang Qiaoxi.

03:18.160 --> 03:20.740
She must be having
a sense of injury in pride.

03:21.440 --> 03:22.960
Even Ms. He said

03:23.000 --> 03:24.860
the sentence he said
was way beyond the curriculum.

03:24.900 --> 03:27.200
Most of us didn't know what it meant.

03:27.240 --> 03:29.280
I don't think she would
get that upset over it.

03:32.300 --> 03:33.700
Honestly,

03:34.620 --> 03:36.220
I think it's your fault.

03:36.940 --> 03:37.940
Mine?

03:38.480 --> 03:40.300
Yeah. Think about it.

03:40.340 --> 03:41.820
You didn't know anything about her,

03:41.860 --> 03:43.920
and you said to her face

03:43.960 --> 03:45.060
right in front of everyone.

03:45.100 --> 03:47.500
You're friends with Jiang Qiaoxi.

03:47.540 --> 03:49.240
So she took it out on him.

03:51.240 --> 03:52.320
What should I do then?

03:55.180 --> 03:57.140
Go apologize to Lin Qile. Seriously.

03:58.480 --> 03:59.860
But let's be real,

03:59.900 --> 04:00.740
it's not your fault.

04:01.240 --> 04:03.720
The real problem was
whoever wrote that letter to Jiang Qiaoxi.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.100
Heard someone tried borrowing your card

04:18.140 --> 04:19.440
and got totally shut down.

04:22.880 --> 04:23.960
If I am allowed,

04:24.000 --> 04:25.040
I would splash water on him.

04:25.580 --> 04:26.840
I'll ask him what his problem is.

04:30.020 --> 04:31.660
Whatever his problem is,

04:32.340 --> 04:33.740
it certainly

04:33.780 --> 04:34.800
doesn't concern us.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.840
Lin Qile, someone's looking for you.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.360
By the stairs. Fourth floor.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.960
Who is it?

04:50.460 --> 04:52.040
You'll know.

04:52.920 --> 04:53.860
What is it about?

04:53.900 --> 04:56.480
Said it needs to be in person.

04:57.340 --> 04:59.120
Come on. I'll go with you.

04:59.620 --> 05:01.500
Only Lin Qile, not you.

05:08.940 --> 05:09.880
I'll go alone.

05:12.760 --> 05:14.420
Lin Qile,

05:14.460 --> 05:15.580
we've actually met before.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.880
Before you transferred
to Jialin Experimental.

05:17.920 --> 05:19.120
Do you remember?

05:21.180 --> 05:22.040
Yeah. I remember.

05:22.080 --> 05:24.180
To get into Jialin Experimental
from Qunshan

05:24.220 --> 05:25.680
with grades like yours,

05:25.720 --> 05:27.180
we all thought you were amazing.

05:27.220 --> 05:28.400
Hope we can

05:28.440 --> 05:30.900
help each other out with school.
Grow together, maybe.

05:33.320 --> 05:34.420
So

05:34.460 --> 05:36.440
what is it you really want to say?

05:37.140 --> 05:38.460
I, um.

05:38.500 --> 05:39.460
I came to apologize.

05:40.000 --> 05:42.300
Back then… yeah, it is my fault.

05:42.340 --> 05:43.280
I mistaken you for others

05:43.320 --> 05:45.120
and said something way out of line.

05:45.660 --> 05:46.720
I'm sorry.

05:51.280 --> 05:53.900
Even if you hadn't mistaken me,

05:53.940 --> 05:55.580
you didn't need to speak like that.

05:55.620 --> 05:57.800
Do you just hate us?

05:57.840 --> 05:59.880
Or do you hate Jiang Qiaoxi?

06:03.640 --> 06:04.800
The truth isn't always pleasant.

06:04.840 --> 06:05.720
So I will not say it.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.660
Lin Qile,

06:07.700 --> 06:09.860
this whole thing really
was some misunderstanding.

06:09.900 --> 06:11.980
Honestly, you and Jiang Qiaoxi
did nothing wrong.

06:12.020 --> 06:13.100
You both got dragged into it.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.760
- Please stop.
- Don't put this on Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:15.800 --> 06:17.060
- He's a good person.
- Can you…

06:17.100 --> 06:18.800
He's the top student for us to look up to.

06:19.300 --> 06:20.140
If anyone's to blame,

06:20.180 --> 06:21.120
it's that Yingtao.

06:21.700 --> 06:24.040
She overstepped.
Writing a letter to him like that?

06:24.620 --> 06:25.820
Stop talking.

06:25.860 --> 06:27.480
You have no idea what was in that letter.

06:27.520 --> 06:29.040
It was disgusting.

06:31.040 --> 06:31.900
Disgusting?

06:32.640 --> 06:34.180
Say that again.

06:34.220 --> 06:35.360
Yu Qiao!

06:36.640 --> 06:37.760
Last time? I let it slide

06:37.800 --> 06:39.120
when you took a swing at me.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.560
Now you're just asking for it.

06:44.780 --> 06:45.680
What's going on?

06:46.520 --> 06:47.660
You guys seriously think

06:47.700 --> 06:49.040
you can throw punches now?

06:49.540 --> 06:50.380
Fine.

06:50.420 --> 06:51.720
We'll see each other in the office.

06:52.400 --> 06:54.580
Fei Linge, why can't you just
talk like a normal person?

06:54.620 --> 06:55.820
Absolutely nothing to talk about.

06:57.680 --> 06:59.460
Oh man, this is bad!

06:59.500 --> 07:01.080
Something serious happened in our class.

07:01.120 --> 07:02.600
It's the new girl, Lin Qile.

07:02.640 --> 07:03.540
She hit someone!

07:04.240 --> 07:06.000
No joke. There was a fight.
She actually hit him!

07:06.040 --> 07:08.000
Come on, let's go check it out.

07:10.240 --> 07:12.340
Fei Linge's tight with the teachers.

07:12.380 --> 07:13.260
They're not gonna

07:13.300 --> 07:14.820
let this slide.

07:14.860 --> 07:16.060
What exactly happened?

07:19.840 --> 07:21.960
Don't worry. I know you.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.100
I'll speak up for you.

07:24.940 --> 07:26.180
I didn't hit him.

07:26.220 --> 07:27.420
No, but you did kick him.

07:27.460 --> 07:28.900
That was self-defense.

07:28.940 --> 07:30.220
But I threw the first punch.

07:32.280 --> 07:33.280
He talked first.

07:33.320 --> 07:34.940
Then it's on him.

07:37.360 --> 07:39.080
Exactly. He's the one who started it.

07:40.020 --> 07:41.300
The teachers at Jialin Experimental

07:41.340 --> 07:42.400
will tell right from wrong.

07:42.440 --> 07:44.300
So we're not worried.

07:44.980 --> 07:46.780
You two really aren't in trouble?

07:46.820 --> 07:47.660
Not with her around.

07:47.700 --> 07:48.980
She can make a rock look innocent.

07:49.020 --> 07:50.060
We'll be fine.

07:50.760 --> 07:51.620
Alright.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.440
Fei Linge and his gang are all bark.

07:53.480 --> 07:55.240
We're better off not giving them

07:55.280 --> 07:56.320
the time of day.

07:57.020 --> 07:58.460
Got it, monitor.

07:58.960 --> 08:00.240
I'll take it from here.

08:05.300 --> 08:07.060
What are you staring at?
Get back to class.

08:09.360 --> 08:10.300
What should I do?

08:10.340 --> 08:11.260
Off to a great start.

08:11.300 --> 08:13.220
It's fine. You've got me.

08:13.720 --> 08:15.020
And you.

08:16.000 --> 08:18.300
I didn't just get myself in trouble.
I dragged you into it too.

08:18.340 --> 08:19.680
Makes sense.

08:20.200 --> 08:21.340
We were like that as kids.

08:32.640 --> 08:33.740
Jiang Qiaoxi?

08:33.780 --> 08:34.919
Come with me.

08:34.960 --> 08:36.679
- Why… Where are we going?
- Sit down.

08:45.300 --> 08:46.700
Why'd they come at you like that?

08:47.240 --> 08:48.460
From what I saw,

08:48.500 --> 08:49.720
Lin Qile barely even looks at you.

08:50.600 --> 08:51.740
You didn't do anything to her.

08:52.240 --> 08:54.180
I think it's because I mistook her

08:54.220 --> 08:55.560
for Yingtao earlier.

08:55.600 --> 08:56.940
She's probably still mad about that,

08:56.980 --> 08:58.380
and now she's taking it out on you.

08:58.420 --> 08:59.400
I figured I'd go apologize.

08:59.440 --> 09:01.980
But those guys are savages.

09:02.480 --> 09:04.480
I barely said a word
and they started pushing me.

09:05.200 --> 09:07.580
And Lin Qile kicked me too.

09:18.040 --> 09:19.660
Let me guess. When you apologized,

09:20.160 --> 09:21.100
you insulted Yingtao?

09:21.640 --> 09:23.240
Well, it's her fault, isn't it?

09:23.280 --> 09:24.540
She wrote that disgusting letter.

09:24.580 --> 09:26.000
Messed things up for you.

09:26.040 --> 09:26.920
If it wasn't for her,

09:26.960 --> 09:27.960
nothing would've happened.

09:28.000 --> 09:29.180
Disgusting?

09:29.680 --> 09:30.940
How was it disgusting?

09:30.980 --> 09:32.040
Wasn't it?

09:32.080 --> 09:33.300
Man, this is…

09:35.420 --> 09:37.000
They are friends.

09:37.040 --> 09:38.540
You said that to her face.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.000
Of course you got kicked.

09:40.800 --> 09:42.780
Jiang Qiaoxi, why are you defending them?

09:42.820 --> 09:43.680
Alright.

09:47.880 --> 09:49.340
From now on,

09:49.380 --> 09:50.420
stay out of my business.

09:51.320 --> 09:52.700
Especially if Lin Qile's involved.

09:53.200 --> 09:54.580
Lin Qile?

09:54.620 --> 09:55.900
You and her…

09:55.940 --> 09:56.780
Yeah, totally.

09:58.280 --> 10:00.120
‪-Is that Jiang Qiaoxi?
‪-He is so cool.

10:05.100 --> 10:06.560
She and I,

10:08.000 --> 10:09.380
we'll be friends.

10:11.940 --> 10:13.820
Something's weird.

10:13.860 --> 10:15.400
Teachers haven't called me in.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.720
And even Fei Linge's been

10:17.760 --> 10:19.640
unusually quiet too.

10:19.680 --> 10:21.680
Probably saw how scary
you can be, Lin Yingtao,

10:21.720 --> 10:22.580
and thought twice

10:22.620 --> 10:23.780
about messing with you.

10:24.780 --> 10:26.720
He needed someone to shut him up.

10:28.120 --> 10:30.040
Let's not push it. I just got here.

10:30.080 --> 10:31.040
Better keep my head down.

10:40.520 --> 10:41.960
I'm sitting here.

10:42.000 --> 10:42.860
You two sit over there.

10:42.900 --> 10:44.120
I want to see

10:44.160 --> 10:45.340
Cai Fangyuan's multimedia player.

10:45.380 --> 10:47.200
Why didn't you say earlier?
I didn't bring it.

10:48.660 --> 10:50.240
Then what did you bring?

10:54.860 --> 10:55.900
Let me see.

10:58.100 --> 10:59.740
Alright, I'll read this.

11:01.940 --> 11:02.780
Yingtao,

11:02.820 --> 11:04.700
are we losing you to the dark side?

11:06.660 --> 11:08.320
Relax, I'm just curious.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.400
Listen up.

11:09.440 --> 11:10.960
Any game strategy you find in books?

11:11.000 --> 11:11.980
Outdated already.

11:12.020 --> 11:13.520
Let me, Cai Fangyuan,

11:13.560 --> 11:15.520
show you how to become a pro
in just three days.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.000
After that,

11:17.040 --> 11:18.700
you'll all be begging me
to play in your team.

11:19.200 --> 11:20.380
Yeah, right.

11:20.420 --> 11:22.400
Isn't your whole strategy
just dropping cash?

11:22.440 --> 11:23.840
Don't underestimate me.

11:23.880 --> 11:24.820
Yingtao.

11:25.320 --> 11:26.360
I'm serious.

11:26.400 --> 11:28.240
World of Warcraft is

11:28.280 --> 11:30.140
more than a game.

11:30.180 --> 11:31.600
It's a way of life.

11:31.640 --> 11:32.560
Here's how it works.

11:32.600 --> 11:33.600
Look.

11:34.100 --> 11:35.380
What are you thinking about?

11:35.880 --> 11:36.920
You sit next to me

11:36.960 --> 11:38.400
and don't say a word?

11:39.740 --> 11:41.140
What's there to talk about?

11:42.800 --> 11:45.180
Qin Yeyun, seriously,

11:45.220 --> 11:47.220
we're the Qunshan Gang.

11:47.260 --> 11:49.120
Why don't you ever hang out with us?

11:49.160 --> 11:50.700
You skipped Dance Machine last time.

11:50.740 --> 11:51.720
You wouldn't believe

11:51.760 --> 11:53.060
how good Lin Yingtao was.

11:56.620 --> 11:58.320
What's so fun about Dance Machine?

12:00.660 --> 12:02.500
Then you pick something.
We'll go with you.

12:02.540 --> 12:04.260
Wait, too fast. I'm lost.

12:08.840 --> 12:10.020
The aquarium.

12:10.060 --> 12:11.040
Will you come with me?

12:12.180 --> 12:14.120
Of course. We'll all go to the aquarium.

12:15.240 --> 12:16.340
Lin Ying…

12:16.380 --> 12:17.440
Lin Qile.

12:17.480 --> 12:19.580
Let's go to the aquarium this weekend.

12:19.620 --> 12:20.620
The aquarium?

12:24.820 --> 12:25.820
I'm not going.

12:25.860 --> 12:27.840
But Qin Yeyun wants to.

12:27.880 --> 12:29.000
We should go for her.

12:35.340 --> 12:36.320
Look, she's upset already.

12:36.360 --> 12:37.320
Just say yes.

12:38.680 --> 12:40.100
Alright, alright, fine.

12:40.140 --> 12:41.140
I'll go.

12:41.900 --> 12:42.820
I'll go.

12:47.300 --> 12:48.220
Yingtao,

12:48.980 --> 12:50.700
why not the aquarium?

13:00.340 --> 13:04.500
OCEAN WORLD

13:52.680 --> 13:53.840
Jiang Qiaoxi,

13:53.880 --> 13:55.360
look at those jellyfish on TV.

13:55.400 --> 13:56.780
They're so pretty.

13:56.820 --> 13:58.180
Kinda makes me want to bite one.

13:58.220 --> 13:59.200
Probably taste amazing.

13:59.820 --> 14:01.060
You can't eat jellyfish.

14:01.100 --> 14:02.820
Most of them are poisonous.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.540
No way.

14:06.040 --> 14:06.940
They're so pretty.

14:07.720 --> 14:08.880
Looks pretty, stings worse.

14:10.740 --> 14:12.120
What are you doing?

14:12.160 --> 14:13.000
Oh no.

14:13.500 --> 14:14.520
Jiang Qiaoxi,

14:14.560 --> 14:15.980
I think I've been poisoned by you.

14:16.600 --> 14:19.420
Help. Somebody help…

14:22.840 --> 14:23.820
Yingtao,

14:23.860 --> 14:24.920
do you like jellyfish?

14:26.220 --> 14:27.740
Let's go see them together someday.

14:29.420 --> 14:31.220
But there's no aquarium in Qunshan.

14:32.240 --> 14:33.300
There is in the city.

14:34.280 --> 14:35.560
But I don't like the city.

14:40.900 --> 14:41.740
Then we won't go.

14:46.900 --> 14:48.300
If you're there,

14:48.800 --> 14:49.660
I'll like it.

14:49.700 --> 14:51.260
Then we're definitely going.

15:37.560 --> 15:38.520
Where are they?

15:38.560 --> 15:40.240
Du Shang and Fangyuan
went to the bathroom.

15:48.280 --> 15:50.200
I was too focused on the fish earlier.

15:50.740 --> 15:51.960
My dolls wanted to see them.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.300
Fish?

15:53.800 --> 15:55.120
Aren't these jellyfish?

15:58.720 --> 15:59.800
Yingtao,

16:00.420 --> 16:02.160
you weren't looking at them

16:02.660 --> 16:04.380
like they were just jellyfish.

16:07.460 --> 16:08.920
Seriously, what's with Qin Yeyun?

16:09.460 --> 16:10.680
She wanted to come,

16:10.720 --> 16:11.900
then bailed last minute.

16:11.940 --> 16:13.360
You're both the same.

16:13.860 --> 16:15.720
Whatever you say or think,

16:15.760 --> 16:17.260
no one else can figure it out.

16:19.100 --> 16:21.100
Be nicer to her.

16:22.340 --> 16:23.860
I'm always nice to her, aren't I?

16:25.300 --> 16:26.900
She can't make it today.

16:26.940 --> 16:28.480
Come with her next time.

16:29.100 --> 16:30.660
Why don't you take her?

16:37.620 --> 16:38.920
I…

16:40.160 --> 16:41.920
I've just had too much on my mind.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.980
No time for anything else.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.540
Bye-bye!

17:15.520 --> 17:16.980
Them again.

17:17.020 --> 17:17.880
Who?

17:17.920 --> 17:19.420
What a small world.

17:24.540 --> 17:25.540
Hey, don't…

17:27.780 --> 17:28.900
What are you doing?

17:28.940 --> 17:31.960
I just wanted to hear
what a busy brain sounds like.

17:32.000 --> 17:33.100
Like the ripe watermelon

17:33.140 --> 17:34.200
with good sounds.

17:34.240 --> 17:36.200
A watermelon is a watermelon.
A brain is a brain.

17:36.240 --> 17:37.760
They're not even comparable.

17:37.800 --> 17:39.320
Wait, are you calling me a dumb melon?

17:39.360 --> 17:41.160
- No! Come on, seriously?
- Get over here.

17:41.200 --> 17:42.920
It was just a joke, lighten up.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.800
I was kidding.

17:43.840 --> 17:46.900
QIN FAMILY MART

17:53.780 --> 17:55.360
Qin Yeyun.

17:55.400 --> 17:56.580
Qin Yeyun.

17:56.620 --> 17:59.640
Qin Yeyun from the snack stand.

18:11.640 --> 18:12.620
That's your reaction?

18:12.660 --> 18:14.180
Do I need any reaction for watching TV?

18:14.220 --> 18:15.440
I'm not the one on screen.

18:17.600 --> 18:18.980
Take a good look, then.

18:19.020 --> 18:20.040
I picked this for you.

18:20.580 --> 18:21.420
Never mind.

18:21.920 --> 18:23.400
Let me see!

18:26.800 --> 18:28.040
Alright then. I'll accept it.

18:31.100 --> 18:32.440
You two kinda look alike.

18:32.480 --> 18:33.320
Same braids.

18:36.260 --> 18:38.360
- Cute, right?
- Yingtao's here!

18:38.400 --> 18:40.000
- Yingtao.
- Uncle Qin.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.700
- Your parents told me
- I will help you.

18:42.740 --> 18:44.500
you guys went to the aquarium today?

18:44.540 --> 18:45.500
Yeah.

18:47.580 --> 18:48.500
Yeyun,

18:48.540 --> 18:49.640
seriously,

18:49.680 --> 18:51.280
sitting around at home again?
Not studying?

18:51.320 --> 18:52.460
Why don't you go outside,

18:52.500 --> 18:54.140
hang out with Yingtao or something?

18:54.180 --> 18:55.720
All you do is watch TV.

18:55.760 --> 18:56.880
You've been at it all day.

18:57.380 --> 18:59.040
What's so great about that show?

18:59.840 --> 19:01.480
You've been sitting here all day for it?

19:02.180 --> 19:04.160
Didn't you say you had
something important to do today?

19:05.020 --> 19:06.280
Watching TV is important.

19:07.420 --> 19:08.340
Come on, move.

19:14.460 --> 19:16.520
What's wrong with you, Qin Yeyun?

19:17.700 --> 19:19.720
Whatever. Not arguing with you.

19:19.760 --> 19:20.760
The episode's over.

19:20.800 --> 19:22.420
I'm coming over to your place.

19:23.600 --> 19:24.980
Who said you could?

19:25.020 --> 19:26.280
My house isn't a convenience store.

19:26.320 --> 19:28.180
I'm doing you a favor.

19:28.220 --> 19:29.740
Dad, I'm heading out!

19:29.780 --> 19:31.360
That favor better be worth it.

19:31.400 --> 19:32.320
I'm good-looking.

19:32.360 --> 19:34.360
- My presence has value.
- You're priceless, alright.

19:44.120 --> 19:45.700
- Where are my slippers?
- I'm going first!

19:45.740 --> 19:46.820
Fine, go.

19:48.320 --> 19:49.440
Yu Qiao.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.160
- Dad.
- Hey, Uncle.

19:50.200 --> 19:51.060
Hey, Uncle.

19:51.100 --> 19:52.060
Shang,

19:52.100 --> 19:53.840
Fangyuan, you guys head inside.

19:53.880 --> 19:55.060
You, come here.

19:55.900 --> 19:57.000
Alright.

19:57.500 --> 19:58.940
- Take my camera in for me.
- Bag too.

20:15.180 --> 20:16.260
You're 16 this year.

20:16.300 --> 20:17.380
17.

20:20.040 --> 20:21.040
Good.

20:21.540 --> 20:22.480
You're growing up.

20:22.980 --> 20:24.280
There's some stuff

20:24.780 --> 20:25.920
we should probably talk about.

20:27.420 --> 20:28.320
Dad,

20:29.080 --> 20:30.020
is everything okay?

20:30.760 --> 20:32.520
Is something going on?

20:39.460 --> 20:40.540
Yu Qiao…

20:43.860 --> 20:45.540
You like someone, don't you?

20:48.180 --> 20:49.680
Look,

20:49.720 --> 20:51.960
I was your age once.

20:52.460 --> 20:53.740
I get it.

20:53.780 --> 20:54.760
I really do.

20:55.300 --> 20:57.220
If you like a girl at your age,

20:57.260 --> 20:58.740
someone you grew up with,

20:58.780 --> 21:00.140
it is totally normal.

21:00.180 --> 21:01.880
But you've got to show it by you kindness

21:01.920 --> 21:03.160
by your capability and actions,

21:03.200 --> 21:04.580
if you like her.

21:04.620 --> 21:07.120
Not by relying on some stupid phone quiz.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.720
And… And remember,

21:08.760 --> 21:11.300
your top priority right now
is your studies.

21:11.340 --> 21:12.620
You're not old enough to date.

21:14.580 --> 21:17.180
Dad, I don't even know
what you're talking about.

21:22.140 --> 21:23.060
You…

21:24.240 --> 21:25.260
You're not

21:25.760 --> 21:26.900
chasing after Yun, are you?

21:28.860 --> 21:29.760
Yun?

21:31.020 --> 21:31.900
Qin Yeyun?

21:32.940 --> 21:34.740
Me? Chasing her?

21:35.740 --> 21:37.080
If I didn't catch those pending

21:37.120 --> 21:38.040
200-yuan phone bills,

21:38.080 --> 21:40.380
I'd never have known
my son's a secret romantic.

21:40.420 --> 21:41.860
Why… What are you even saying?

21:50.820 --> 21:52.020
Yu Jin!

21:52.060 --> 21:53.760
Who told you to sneak my phone again?

21:54.260 --> 21:56.040
Yu Qiao, I was asleep!

22:04.280 --> 22:08.140
SOLIDARITY, COMPASSION,
PROFESSIONALISM, DEVOTION

22:08.180 --> 22:09.780
It's not even that funny, okay?

22:10.280 --> 22:11.540
What, that's not funny?

22:11.580 --> 22:12.440
Can't believe Yu Jin

22:12.480 --> 22:14.700
really trusted those cringey
love tests from TV ads.

22:15.580 --> 22:17.280
Please, like you're any better.

22:17.320 --> 22:19.160
You liked Xiaozhao,
the in-game girl for elementary.

22:20.260 --> 22:22.640
Qin Yeyun is proud of her appreance.

22:23.140 --> 22:24.620
If she ever finds out about this,

22:24.660 --> 22:26.140
she'll be over the moon.

22:36.060 --> 22:37.420
What does that have to do with me?

22:39.080 --> 22:41.140
Qin Yeyun! Why are you running?

22:41.880 --> 22:43.000
Just drop it.

22:43.500 --> 22:45.180
You love a bit of drama, don't you?

22:45.220 --> 22:46.420
What's so funny?

22:49.100 --> 22:50.480
And you.

22:50.520 --> 22:51.920
Your laugh's horrendous.

23:01.720 --> 23:02.760
Get lost!

23:03.260 --> 23:04.440
It's me.

23:05.920 --> 23:07.160
Exactly. Lin Yingtao.

23:07.200 --> 23:08.620
I don't want to see you.

23:09.760 --> 23:11.840
I'm on your side.

23:11.880 --> 23:13.660
I just stuck up for you and told them off.

23:13.700 --> 23:15.320
Who asked you to?

23:17.280 --> 23:18.260
You annoy me.

23:18.300 --> 23:19.420
I can't stand all of you.

23:23.220 --> 23:25.440
This is all Yu Qiao's fault.
He's such a dope.

23:25.940 --> 23:27.240
Doesn't understand anything.

23:29.380 --> 23:30.220
Why don't we just

23:30.260 --> 23:31.700
go talk to him?

23:31.740 --> 23:32.580
Clear things up.

23:33.200 --> 23:34.240
What things?

23:34.280 --> 23:36.500
Just tell him whatever's on your mind.

23:36.540 --> 23:37.580
He deserves to know.

23:38.340 --> 23:39.680
There's nothing

23:39.720 --> 23:40.960
between you two.

23:43.740 --> 23:44.740
Come on.

23:44.780 --> 23:46.320
You are the one between…

23:51.640 --> 23:52.840
If you tell him,

23:52.880 --> 23:54.700
we won't even be friends anymore.

23:55.200 --> 23:56.700
That's something between us, right?

24:01.460 --> 24:03.580
I think it's fine how it is.

24:04.080 --> 24:05.820
I'm not asking for anything.

24:06.860 --> 24:08.340
As long as I can see him every day,

24:08.380 --> 24:10.440
talk to him like normal… That's enough.

24:24.200 --> 24:26.640
Great. I must've looked hideous just now.

24:37.820 --> 24:38.900
You did look hideous.

24:38.940 --> 24:40.140
Like a gremlin.

24:41.140 --> 24:42.420
Still cuter than you.

24:54.740 --> 24:57.860
IF YOU DON'T WANT TO
DRIFT THROUGH LIFE, STUDY FOR LIFE.

24:58.460 --> 25:00.120
You took all these?

25:01.800 --> 25:02.980
Pretty good, right?

25:03.940 --> 25:05.220
They're actually really nice.

25:05.260 --> 25:06.420
I know, right?

25:14.260 --> 25:15.160
Jiang Qiaoxi.

25:16.380 --> 25:17.540
Cen Xiaoman and I took these

25:17.580 --> 25:19.300
while we were at the aquarium.

25:21.160 --> 25:23.600
Takes time to really
look at photos, you know.

25:24.340 --> 25:26.080
Did you finish my Olympiad math questions?

25:26.120 --> 25:27.120
Not yet.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.280
Jiang Qiaoxi,

25:31.320 --> 25:33.160
there's one more thing
I wanted to tell you.

25:33.200 --> 25:34.720
But promise you won't get mad, okay?

25:34.760 --> 25:36.680
I'm only saying it
because I consider you a friend.

25:37.180 --> 25:38.020
Go ahead.

25:38.560 --> 25:40.180
That day, when we were at the aquarium,

25:40.220 --> 25:41.960
we ran into Yu Qiao and Lin Qile.

25:42.940 --> 25:44.200
Lin Qile, honestly,

25:44.240 --> 25:46.240
made it this far here, in my opinion,

25:46.280 --> 25:47.860
is because of Yu Qiao.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.580
So maybe that's why she was

25:49.620 --> 25:50.740
- so cold to you before.
- Stop.

25:51.580 --> 25:53.880
- That's not possible.
- I'm serious.

25:53.920 --> 25:54.820
Also…

25:57.160 --> 25:59.560
Okay, okay, I'll shut up.

25:59.600 --> 26:01.100
Take your time with the problems.

26:26.580 --> 26:29.180
Line AD is the x-axis.

26:30.240 --> 26:32.160
Line AB is the y-axis.

26:32.200 --> 26:33.880
Yeah, yeah, I got it.

26:33.920 --> 26:35.660
AE is the z-axis.

26:36.780 --> 26:37.900
Didn't we just learn this?

26:54.960 --> 26:57.440
Is there a better way to solve it?

27:03.720 --> 27:06.080
Jiang Qiaoxi,
come do this one on the board.

27:06.120 --> 27:07.940
This problem's got a lot of steps.

27:07.980 --> 27:10.020
For someone like Lin Qile,
it might be tricky.

27:10.060 --> 27:11.380
Easy to slip up.

27:12.140 --> 27:14.440
But if we draw an extra line,

27:14.480 --> 27:15.800
it gets simpler.

27:22.360 --> 27:24.720
First, take point N as the midpoint of EB.

27:24.760 --> 27:27.860
Then connect MN, and also connect NC.

27:29.300 --> 27:31.980
From there, you apply the theorem
for line-plane parallelism,

27:32.020 --> 27:34.380
and the whole thing
becomes easier to solve.

27:35.380 --> 27:36.320
See?

27:36.820 --> 27:38.760
Give any tough question to Jiang Qiaoxi,

27:38.800 --> 27:40.140
and he makes it look easy.

27:52.080 --> 27:54.340
Very good.
Two ways to approach the problem.

27:54.380 --> 27:55.800
Everyone, take a look.

27:55.840 --> 27:57.640
KNOWLEDGE AND VISION

27:58.180 --> 28:00.340
Cai Fangyuan. Cai Fangyuan!

28:00.380 --> 28:01.380
Let's go.

28:02.760 --> 28:04.160
- Make mine warm.
- Add a teabag.

28:05.260 --> 28:06.420
Water card.

28:06.960 --> 28:09.360
- Water card, please.
- Using mine again?

28:09.400 --> 28:10.260
Cut it.

28:10.300 --> 28:11.360
Here.

28:41.260 --> 28:42.200
Nothing fancy.

28:42.700 --> 28:43.700
Just water.

29:23.040 --> 29:25.120
Wait, you're getting water
for Cai Fangyuan?

29:26.120 --> 29:27.800
Is that Yu Qiao's cup?

29:29.120 --> 29:29.960
Yep. And Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:33.420 --> 29:34.440
Lin Qile

29:34.480 --> 29:35.940
asked you to get water for Jiang Qiaoxi?

29:35.980 --> 29:38.760
She had something to do, so I helped out.

29:38.800 --> 29:40.180
Just filling her friends' cups.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.780
It's no trouble.

29:41.820 --> 29:43.480
Who said he's a friend?

29:44.240 --> 29:45.940
You can't tell there's
something off between us?

29:47.840 --> 29:49.180
If Lin Qile finds out,

29:49.220 --> 29:50.700
she's gonna be pissed.

30:31.400 --> 30:32.540
You filled this for me?

30:32.580 --> 30:35.020
Yeah, that was me. I took it upon myself.

30:35.060 --> 30:36.820
Lin Qile didn't want to.

30:36.860 --> 30:37.840
Don't get the wrong idea.

30:38.340 --> 30:40.460
From now on, I'll just do it.

30:40.500 --> 30:42.120
- No need to bother her.
- You don't have to.

30:42.160 --> 30:43.800
Wait, did she ask you to say that?

30:46.920 --> 30:48.440
Look, we're in the same class.

30:48.940 --> 30:50.980
If you can't be friends,

30:51.480 --> 30:53.660
at least stay out of each other's way.

31:04.600 --> 31:05.440
Beat you next time.

31:05.940 --> 31:07.240
Off you go.

31:19.960 --> 31:20.980
Lin Qile.

31:21.540 --> 31:22.600
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

31:49.200 --> 31:51.260
I won't stick my nose
in your business anymore.

31:55.480 --> 31:56.840
So you did get all the waters?

31:58.020 --> 31:59.500
Don't be mad.

32:01.180 --> 32:02.680
I gave Jiang Qiaoxi a heads-up too.

32:03.180 --> 32:04.060
He probably

32:04.560 --> 32:06.060
won't bug you anymore.

32:10.220 --> 32:11.260
Thanks.

32:22.260 --> 32:24.360
Today's physical education test is

32:25.000 --> 32:27.600
800 meters for girls and 1500 for boys.

32:27.640 --> 32:29.460
Let's try to finish it in this class.

32:29.500 --> 32:31.260
- This sucks.
- You've got to be kidding…

32:32.080 --> 32:34.240
- Kill me now.
- I can't run that.

32:34.280 --> 32:36.200
Why the long faces?

32:36.240 --> 32:37.320
You can't escape it,

32:37.360 --> 32:38.600
even in senior year.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.480
Calling the roll now.

32:39.980 --> 32:41.480
- Song Chuyang.
- You don't feel well?

32:41.520 --> 32:43.120
- Here.
- Feng Letian.

32:43.160 --> 32:44.340
- Here.
- I'm okay.

32:44.840 --> 32:45.600
- Want me to ask
- Jiang Sisi.

32:45.640 --> 32:46.420
- for leave for you?
- Here.

32:46.460 --> 32:48.360
Sir, I'd like to sit this out.

32:48.400 --> 32:49.380
I'm not feeling great.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.040
Anyone else?

32:51.080 --> 32:52.600
- Sir…
- Me, too.

32:52.640 --> 32:53.820
Sir, I…

32:54.320 --> 32:55.420
Never mind.

32:55.460 --> 32:56.760
Either way, I'll have to do it.

32:58.260 --> 32:59.600
Go, Jiang Qiaoxi!

32:59.640 --> 33:01.060
- Come on!
- Let's go!

33:01.100 --> 33:02.600
Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:02.640 --> 33:03.500
Come on!

33:03.540 --> 33:04.720
Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:04.760 --> 33:05.620
Come on!

33:05.660 --> 33:07.740
- Jiang Qiaoxi…
- Let's go…

33:07.780 --> 33:09.440
- Keep going.
- Jiang Qiaoxi…

33:09.480 --> 33:10.900
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:10.940 --> 33:12.860
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:12.900 --> 33:15.660
Jiang Qiaoxi…

33:16.940 --> 33:17.980
Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:18.020 --> 33:18.900
Keep going!

33:18.940 --> 33:19.860
Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:20.940 --> 33:22.420
- Keep going!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:22.460 --> 33:24.120
- You alright?
- Yeah. Yeah.

33:24.160 --> 33:25.740
- I'm good.
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

33:26.860 --> 33:28.060
Keep going!

33:47.840 --> 33:49.220
Keep going! Come on…

33:49.720 --> 33:50.880
Almost there…

34:10.420 --> 34:13.159
Push through! Come on!

34:15.020 --> 34:16.480
Jiang Qiaoxi, you got this!

34:16.520 --> 34:17.699
You got this!

34:26.260 --> 34:27.520
You think

34:28.020 --> 34:29.120
you can outrun me?

34:29.659 --> 34:31.540
I'm not here to race you.

34:32.340 --> 34:33.760
I want you to know something.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.820
People saw you two at the aquarium.
Now they're talking.

34:37.380 --> 34:39.000
I know there's nothing between you two,

34:39.040 --> 34:40.739
but people don't see it that way.

34:41.800 --> 34:42.840
Run faster.

34:42.880 --> 34:44.420
You think you know better?

34:45.620 --> 34:46.780
What, you suddenly know us?

34:48.340 --> 34:49.739
I know Lin Yingtao.

34:49.780 --> 34:51.960
Don't say her name.

34:52.000 --> 34:53.380
She's got nothing to do with you.

34:54.260 --> 34:55.300
Yu Qiao,

34:56.360 --> 34:58.360
I'm saying this for her sake.

35:00.160 --> 35:01.100
For Lin Yingtao,

35:01.140 --> 35:02.580
it will make things worse. Understand?

35:04.420 --> 35:05.600
You're making things worse.

35:17.360 --> 35:18.300
What else

35:18.920 --> 35:19.880
was in that letter?

35:19.920 --> 35:20.920
What letter?

35:20.960 --> 35:22.120
I know

35:23.000 --> 35:24.540
you've got the rest of it.

35:25.320 --> 35:26.160
Hand it over.

35:27.380 --> 35:29.340
I took it from Fei Linge.

35:29.840 --> 35:31.360
You could've fought for it back then.

35:45.260 --> 35:46.260
Try to breathe.

35:46.300 --> 35:48.720
Inhale, two steps. Exhale, two steps.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.940
Don't rush it.

35:56.360 --> 35:57.860
Keep going!

36:00.420 --> 36:01.500
Keep going!

36:03.640 --> 36:04.540
Come on!

36:04.580 --> 36:05.560
Come on!

36:05.600 --> 36:06.840
Keep going!

36:07.560 --> 36:08.600
Come on!

36:08.640 --> 36:09.620
Come on!

36:09.660 --> 36:12.200
- Push through!
- Almost there, Xiaoman!

36:12.240 --> 36:13.140
Xiaoman takes the lead!

36:13.180 --> 36:14.060
Keep going!

36:15.460 --> 36:17.300
Come on…

36:17.340 --> 36:18.320
Almost there…

36:19.440 --> 36:21.640
Easy. Slow down.

36:31.860 --> 36:33.160
Not bad, Lin Qile.

36:34.520 --> 36:35.960
You were killing it out there…

36:39.580 --> 36:41.060
Xiaoman doesn't like peanut milk.

36:41.100 --> 36:43.020
She's more of a Coke girl.
I'll get it for her.

36:43.620 --> 36:44.480
It's not for her.

36:44.520 --> 36:45.640
It's for Lin Qile.

36:46.140 --> 36:47.620
Lin Qile fainted just now.

36:48.420 --> 36:49.740
They took her to the nurse's office.

36:51.040 --> 36:52.040
- She fainted?
- Yes.

37:10.100 --> 37:10.940
Here, drink this.

37:10.980 --> 37:12.860
Thanks, Ms.

37:14.080 --> 37:14.940
Ms.

37:14.980 --> 37:15.980
Is she okay?

37:16.020 --> 37:17.300
Does she need to go to a hospital?

37:17.340 --> 37:19.000
She's alright. Don't worry.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.220
Just a little heatstroke.

37:20.260 --> 37:21.320
She wasn't in the best shape.

37:21.360 --> 37:22.540
A good nap and she'll be fine.

37:22.580 --> 37:23.500
Here.

37:23.540 --> 37:25.080
You all should head back to class.

37:25.120 --> 37:26.940
Too much noise and she can't rest.

37:26.980 --> 37:27.920
I'll take this.

37:34.000 --> 37:35.020
Feeling better?

37:38.180 --> 37:39.440
Just stay here and sleep.

37:39.480 --> 37:40.640
Sleep all afternoon if you want.

37:40.680 --> 37:42.140
I'll grab lunch for you.

37:45.960 --> 37:48.220
You two don't have to hang around.

37:48.260 --> 37:49.740
Go back to class.

37:55.620 --> 37:56.860
Go on, I'm good here.

38:00.660 --> 38:01.840
See you, Ms.

38:01.880 --> 38:02.800
Bye, Ms.

39:30.820 --> 39:32.580
Jiang Qiaoxi…

39:32.620 --> 39:34.820
Yingtao, any better?

39:35.860 --> 39:37.780
I really want some peanut milk.

39:38.400 --> 39:40.140
But Mom says

39:40.180 --> 39:42.740
I can't have cold drinks with a fever.

39:42.780 --> 39:44.640
Only warm water.

39:44.680 --> 39:46.300
But I hate warm water.

39:46.340 --> 39:47.880
Help me.

39:54.400 --> 39:55.360
Don't worry.

39:55.860 --> 39:57.060
Auntie Juan's at work.

39:57.100 --> 39:59.060
I warmed up the peanut milk for you.

39:59.100 --> 40:00.260
Drink up.

40:07.600 --> 40:08.620
Jiang Qiaoxi,

40:09.120 --> 40:10.100
you're so sweet.

40:10.980 --> 40:12.640
I hate being sick.

40:13.400 --> 40:14.840
When I get sick,

40:14.880 --> 40:16.460
you stay with me the whole time.

40:16.500 --> 40:17.540
Got it?

40:19.280 --> 40:20.540
Jiang Qiaoxi,

40:22.560 --> 40:23.740
it's just better…

40:25.640 --> 40:26.600
when you're around.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.940
What is it? Too hot?

40:54.580 --> 40:55.560
What are you doing here?

40:57.520 --> 40:58.840
Came to check on you.

40:58.880 --> 41:00.360
I didn't ask you to.

41:00.400 --> 41:01.560
Who even are we now?

41:01.600 --> 41:02.640
I don't need your care.

41:03.980 --> 41:05.500
Technically,

41:05.540 --> 41:07.000
we're just

41:07.040 --> 41:08.140
classmates now.

41:10.100 --> 41:11.640
Thanks for the visit, then.

41:11.680 --> 41:13.300
But I'm fine.

41:13.340 --> 41:14.660
Don't sit here.

41:14.700 --> 41:16.180
If the teacher shows up,

41:16.220 --> 41:17.060
what are we gonna say?

41:17.100 --> 41:18.000
You should go.

41:18.040 --> 41:19.020
It's fine.

41:19.060 --> 41:20.600
I'll just say I came here

41:20.640 --> 41:21.840
to get some medicine.

41:22.520 --> 41:23.660
Aren't you too proud to lie?

41:24.920 --> 41:26.560
I can when it's about you.

41:27.340 --> 41:28.600
Well, don't bother.

41:30.300 --> 41:31.760
Alright, I won't say anything.

41:40.440 --> 41:41.540
Then leave.

41:46.520 --> 41:47.920
Didn't you just say

41:48.520 --> 41:50.600
it's better when I'm around?

41:54.760 --> 41:56.320
I wasn't talking about you.

41:58.600 --> 41:59.880
I'm pretty sure

42:00.580 --> 42:01.820
you used to say

42:02.820 --> 42:04.520
I had to stay with you

42:04.560 --> 42:05.800
whenever you got sick.

42:05.840 --> 42:07.240
Did I?

42:07.280 --> 42:08.120
I don't remember.

42:09.700 --> 42:10.620
That's okay.

42:10.660 --> 42:11.780
I remember for both of us.

42:12.580 --> 42:13.680
Jiang Qiaoxi…

42:18.820 --> 42:20.980
Why do you keep saying the same things

42:21.020 --> 42:22.000
over and over?

42:22.040 --> 42:23.500
Don't you have anything new to say?

42:23.540 --> 42:24.940
Are you going or not?

42:28.120 --> 42:28.960
You won't? I will.

42:32.400 --> 42:33.520
I'll go.

42:34.440 --> 42:35.680
Get some rest.

42:36.840 --> 42:37.840
Can you…

42:38.880 --> 42:41.680
Can you stop saying stuff like that?

42:41.720 --> 42:43.580
I don't like it. It's exhausting.

42:44.340 --> 42:45.240
Okay.

42:46.260 --> 42:47.200
I hear you.

42:49.400 --> 42:51.400
Jiang Qiaoxi, what are you doing here?

42:54.900 --> 42:55.840
Ms.

42:57.180 --> 42:58.960
- She told me not to say anything…
- Ms,

42:59.760 --> 43:01.480
he came looking for you because

43:01.520 --> 43:02.420
he wasn't feeling well,

43:02.460 --> 43:03.580
but you weren't in.

43:04.080 --> 43:05.320
Where isn't he feeling well?

43:06.060 --> 43:06.940
His brain, he says.

43:06.980 --> 43:08.240
His brain?

43:12.420 --> 43:13.460
Ms,

43:14.160 --> 43:16.040
I just promised someone I wouldn't lie.

43:16.080 --> 43:17.660
So here's the truth.

43:17.700 --> 43:19.700
We're classmates.

43:19.740 --> 43:20.680
And

43:21.180 --> 43:22.420
I came here just to check on her.

43:24.540 --> 43:25.620
I'll go now, Ms.

45:53.200 --> 45:56.080
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
